From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 181] panvk: optional tally of emitted tiler heap operations
Generated-by: LLM

Debug only: PANVK_HEAP_TRACE=1 counts the heap operations recorded
(vertex-tiler started/completed, fragment finish, fragment end, fragment
passes) and logs the totals every 512 fragment passes. biblioklept

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/180

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
